      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Every attempt to join these existing instances displays the following error (translated from Russian):\n\n“That instance is using an outdated version of VRChat. You won't be able to join them until they update!”\n\nHowever, I can create and successfully join new private instances in both US East and Europe. Therefore, the problem is specifically with joining existing instances.\n\nRelevant events from output_log_2026-10-28_20-00-57.txt:\n\n20:01:47 — Successfully joined a new private instance of “Just A Cabin” in US East.\n\n20:03:05 and 20:03:08 — Existing public EU instance rejected with the outdated-version error.\n\n20:03:25 — Successfully joined a new private instance of “POLAND” in Europe.\n\n20:05:12 and 20:05:13 — Existing US East instance rejected with the same outdated-version error.\n\nEarlier EU connection attempts also produced “Operation timed out” and “Failed to connect to network region,” although creating and joining a new EU instance later succeeded.\n\nI have restarted VRChat multiple times. The logs show “AntiCheat Session Begin: Success.”",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
